  dtype `dtype` and shape `[d_1, d_2, ..., d_n, maxlen]`, with

  ```
  mask[i_1, i_2, ..., i_n, j] = (j < lengths[i_1, i_2, ..., i_n])
  ```

  Examples:

  ```python
  tf.sequence_mask([1, 3, 2], 5)  # [[True, False, False, False, False],
                                  #  [True, True, True, False, False],
                                  #  [True, True, False, False, False]]

